ion $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=3 \\left(x - 2\\right)^{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "Integrating the equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (3 \\left(x - 2\\right)^{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =3\\int \\left(x - 2\\right)^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\left(\\frac{\\left(x - 2\\right)^{3}}{3}\\right)+C \\\\ y & =\\left(x - 2\\right)^{3}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now plot the solution curves by selecting different values for $C.$ The sketch below shows the solution curves for $C=-2,0,2.$\n\n![](images/0a/0a2609542e1b48653ea5d167bb34d62f8b4ddefe3412b2a3c8804b7b50284fab.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["d0d95b6a-70bd-53d9-b60a-4df910d6ad89"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "a81f77a2-6dd5-5d7a-88bf-ba50595b238d" :answer/id #uuid "a81f77a2-6dd5-5d7a-88bf-ba50595b238d" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/e9/e9bf393362331bba0ce4cd1ad2f85bc300c340eac451b3e44cf9a7d82c1a519d.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2e1e8205-a3a1-54f9-be35-36c48fa91e07" :answer/id #uuid "2e1e8205-a3a1-54f9-be35-36c48fa91e07" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/d7/d79f542f2d7066f0d08c935ee07eb17f12bdb4bc03b0d50a9b3b55f493ef3fbd.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cbb2d373-4142-52a2-8286-325b9784e2e8" :answer/id #uuid "cbb2d373-4142-52a2-8286-325b9784e2e8" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/92/9239d5fa24b4470527313e87be01cdfa12511a0bb5008bc8a1584b018b9faf66.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f4bfb58f-2a48-58c7-8f84-d943df4fff49" :answer/id #uuid "f4bfb58f-2a48-58c7-8f84-d943df4fff49" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/e6/e6497eec57bbd7a05803dc6218a2cb0363becc62b41c19cb3d90d701ebacc801.png" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1d6a1146-7f52-5c21-8481-707664564a73" :answer/id #uuid "1d6a1146-7f52-5c21-8481-707664564a73" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "images/42/423249f8